  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "hotpoint SA2 oven not heatin on fan, grill ok. wat does SA2 mean??"
  },
  {
   "role": "assistant",
   "text": "In this context, SA2 is the specific model code for your Hotpoint oven-cooker. It identifies the exact appliance variant to help determine compatible parts and specifications. From what you have described, the most likely cause is fan / rear ring element [fan-oven mode]. Set it to 180°C on the fan function for 15 minutes. Is it heating up properly now, or still not?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "tried that, still barely warms up on fan. fan isnt spinning, just a low hum from the back. also SA2 is just printed on the front trim, so is it a fault code or not?"
  },
  {
   "role": "assistant",
   "text": "No, SA2 is not a fault code; it is part of the model number for your Hotpoint oven-cooker. From what you have checked, this needs an appliance engineer to look at it: the next steps are beyond the checks that are safe to do yourself."
  }
